ROS 2 - Project 1 

1. Build the Package : 
cd ~/teleop_ws
colcon build --packages-select my_teleop_robot --symlink-install
source install/setup.bash
sudo apt install -y xterm

2.Launch Everything :
Terminal 1
source ~/teleop_ws/install/setup.bash
ros2 launch my_teleop_robot simulation.launch.py

Terminal 2 (RViz)
source ~/teleop_ws/install/setup.bash
rviz2 -d ~/teleop_ws/src/my_teleop_robot/rviz/config.rviz
